        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, if we manufacture all of our commercial supplies of bulk drug product with a manufacturer other than WuXi Biologics or its affiliates, we are required to make royalty payments to WuXi Biologics in an amount equal to a fraction of a single digit percentage of global net sales of WuXi Biologics Licensed Products manufactured by a third-party manufacturer (the “Royalty”).",
        "start_character": 68258,
        "end_character": 68643
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Any product candidates that we successfully develop and commercialize will compete with existing therapies and new therapies that may become available in the future.",
        "start_character": 72734,
        "end_character": 72899
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we manufacture part of our commercial supplies of the WuXi Biologics Licensed Products with WuXi Biologics or its affiliates, then the Royalty will be reduced accordingly on a pro rata basis.",
        "start_character": 68644,
        "end_character": 68838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regulations in the United States, we are subject to a variety of regulations in other jurisdictions governing, among other things, research and development, clinical trials, testing, manufacturing, safety, efficacy, quality control, labeling, packaging, storage, record keeping, distribution, reporting, export and import, advertising, marketing and other promotional practices involving biological products as well as authorization, approval as well as post-approval monitoring and reporting of our products.",
        "start_character": 171928,
        "end_character": 172452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, because of the extensive time required for clinical development and regulatory review of a product candidate we may develop, it is possible that, before any of our product candidates can be commercialized, any related patent may expire or remain in force for only a short period following commercialization, thereby limiting the protection such patent would afford the respective product and any competitive advantage such patent may provide.",
        "start_character": 102527,
        "end_character": 102982
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Key competitive factors affecting the success of all our product candidates that we develop, if approved, are likely to be efficacy, safety, convenience, presentation, price, the level of generic competition and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
        "start_character": 73869,
        "end_character": 74160
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of the companies with which we are currently competing or will complete against in the future have significantly greater financial resources and expertise in research and development, manufacturing, preclinical testing, conducting clinical trials, obtaining regulatory approvals and marketing approved products than we do.",
        "start_character": 72900,
        "end_character": 73227
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the IL-13 License Agreement, the IL-4Rα License Agreement and the OX40L License Agreement, we are obligated to pay Paragon up to $3.0 million upon the achievement of specific development and clinical milestones for the first product under each of the License Agreements that achieves such specified milestones, including a payment of $1.0 million upon the nomination of a development candidate and $2.0 million upon the first dosing of a human patient in a Phase 1 trial.",
        "start_character": 61765,
        "end_character": 62242
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001974640-26-000002",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001974640-26-000002-0540f2a599b9b66d",
        "accession_number": "0001974640-26-000002",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the TSLP License Agreement, we are obligated to pay Paragon up to $28.0 million upon the achievement of specific development and clinical milestones for the first product, including a payment of $3.0 million upon the nomination of a development candidate and $5.0 million upon the first dosing of a human patient in a Phase 1 trial.",
        "start_character": 62243,
        "end_character": 62581
      },
      {
